  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 701.03 Incomplete Form Returned. In the event a person submits a form not in compliance with Liq 700, such form shall not be processed. The form shall be returned to the submitting party with the reasons for such return noted.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Liq 700) #13114, eff 9-25-20",
